{"id":"5984f0527f1f4cba","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-prf-decidable.md","title":"fact-prf-decidable — Proof Predicate Decidable","display":"fact-prf-decidable — Proof Predicate Decidable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-prf-decidable","aliases":["92-fact-prf-decidable"],"display":"fact-prf-decidable — Proof Predicate Decidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-prf-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-prf-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-prf-decidable — Proof Predicate Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (proof-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span> (elementary-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (pairing encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set of encoded proof/conclusion pairs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}prf\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}prf\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>编码一个以公式码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>为结论的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明</li>\n<li>可判定性：存在算法判定<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k, m)\">\\((k, m)\\)</span>是否满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}\\)</span></li>\n<li>验证步骤：\n<ol>\n<li>解码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>得到证明序列<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span></li>\n<li>解码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>得到公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>验证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>的每一步是否合法</li>\n<li>验证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>的最后元素是否是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>初等性保证公理检验与规则检验可判定，故整个有限证明检查可判定</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$ (proof-code predicate, see [[92-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Elem}$ (elementary-system predicate, see [[92-df-elementary-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dec}$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[92-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}prf\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Prf},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_{\\mathrm{Prf},G})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"(k, m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7e21e34fc6bec397","b090f61b9f3ec664","360e00ddf38f0f16","20fe67463d98fb92"]}